    <string-array name="flash_quips_flashing">
        <item>The image is Google\'s own. Bookmend just carries the bytes.</item>
        <item>Your phone is doing a laptop\'s job right now.</item>
        <item>Long images take a while. That\'s normal.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="flash_quips_verifying">
        <item>Reading everything back, to be sure.</item>
        <item>A checked drive is one less thing to wonder about.</item>
    </string-array>
